                url  : http://www.mollybrown.org  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : This restored Victorian was once home to labor reformist, actress and ''Titanic'' survivor Margaret Brown. It now showcases that era of Colorado history through exhibits and special events. Museum is limited to 16 visitors at a time, so purchasing tickets in advance is highly recommended. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#121</styleUrl>
                <Point id="872">
