                url  : http://www.ballparkmuseum.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A family-run museum that contains one of the best private baseball collections in the country, this museum holds a stunning collection of artifacts from ballparks all over the country, including signs, bricks, and seats from the classic ballparks of old, as well as a section of Fenway Park's &quot;Green Monster&quot;. &lt;br&gt;
