                <description>
                category  : See_Parks and gardens &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 1241 W. Bayaud Ave  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A 20-foot-high sculpture of a dog, made out of metal dog tags. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
