                url  : http://www.coclubs.com/the-church/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Part of the &quot;SoCo&quot; (South of Colfax) club district, the Church is one of the most popular dance clubs in the city, and as its name suggests, is housed in a former Episcopalian church. That however, does not prevent hundreds if not thousands of people from descending on the dance floor every night to shake what God has given them. &lt;br&gt;
