                <description>
                category  : Drink_Bars elsewhere in Denver &lt;br&gt;
                address  : 7577 East Academy Blvd  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.lowrybeergarden.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : In the Lowry neighborhood, this beer garden is in between two of the old airplane hangars that made up Lowry Air Force Base. The Garden offers a thoughtful draft and bottled beer selection with a focus on Colorado and handcrafted brews. The Lowry Beer Garden also serves up your favorite casual fare with locally-made gourmet brats &amp; sausages, freshly-baked pretzels, house-ground burgers, hand-cut fries and chef-created salads. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
